  title: Ramakrishna Mission
  text: Swami Vivekananda founded the Ramakrishna Mission in 1897 in the name of his teacher, Ramakrishna Paramahamsa. It joins spirituality with social service. Vivekananda's address to the Parliament of Religions in Chicago in 1893 is famous.
